# __DISPLAY__

A Spica plugin. __DESCRIPTION__

| Tool | What it does | Irreversible |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `list_items` | List items, newest first | no |
| `get_item` | Read one item | no |
| `add_item` | Add an item | no |
| `remove_item` | Remove an item | **yes** (Spica asks first) |

- Mock mode: answers from the fictional sample in `mock/items.json`.
- Errors start with a code, e.g. `[ITEM_NOT_FOUND]`; see `server/errors.js`.
- Data is kept in the plugin's data folder (`SPICA_PLUGIN_DATA`).

Develop: `node --test test/` · check and pack: `node <skill>/scripts/check.mjs .` ·
install: `node <skill>/scripts/install.mjs dist/__NAME__-0.1.0.zip ...`
